== Effect ==
* Grants Isaac's [[familiar]]s [[Tear Effects#Homing|homing shots]].
** This includes the shots fired by {{c|Lilith}} and {{C|Tainted Lilith|r}}'s attached familiar.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Using {{P|I - The Magician}} with {{i|Tarot Cloth}} will unlock this item.
** {{dlc|r}} Tarot Cloth with the card has a unique effect and does not count as two uses for unlocking purposes.
* Using {{i|Telepathy For Dummies}} twice in the same room will unlock this item.
** Using it once with {{i|Car Battery}} will work.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either makes familiar tears gain the {{t|Brain Worm|n}} effect. Having both makes familiars gain the {{t|Tape Worm|n}} effect on top.
* {{i|The Intruder}}: Baby-Bender applies to The Intruder's projectiles while it is still in Isaac's head.

